# CodeQL false positives for THIS repository's own analysis (`.github/workflows/default.yaml`).
#
# The gate (`global/scripts/tools/codeql/gate.sh` in rios0rios0/pipelines) reads
# `.codeql-false-positives` from the root of the repository being scanned, so this file applies
# here and nowhere else.
#
# Format: each `primaryLocationLineHash` alone on its line, exactly as the gate prints it -- a
# line is compared whole, so a trailing comment silences nothing. The hash covers the flagged
# line and about the next hundred non-blank characters, so editing that code changes it and
# brings the finding back for a fresh look: an entry vouches for the code as it was read, not for
# whatever replaces it.
