# in explicitly, per-resource or per-provider, to reach an endpoint with a self-signed
# certificate -- skipping verification IS the feature, so the finding cannot be fixed without
# removing it. The transport keeps `MinVersion: tls.VersionTLS13`, and the line already carries a
# `//nolint:gosec` for golangci-lint's identical G402 finding; this is the CodeQL equivalent.
